                "section_components": [
                    {
                        "titleV2": "Pooja Thanki",
                        "caption": "January 25, 2024, Pooja was senior to Refugio(Jose) but didn't manage Refugio(Jose) directly",
                        "subtitle": "Engineering Leader | Technology Strategist |  Building High-Performing Engineering Teams",
                        "size": "LARGE",
                        "textActionTarget": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/poojathanki",
                        "image": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5603AQEHpICCNjcdxw/profile-displayphoto-shrink_100_100/profile-displayphoto-shrink_100_100/0/1700109984811?e=1758153600&v=beta&t=01HUQs_2VzO4tNhreM9gRtWq9iy-vf4R-JfVxQbam3E",
                        "subComponents": [
                            {
                                "fixedListComponent": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "textComponent",
                                        "text": "Having had the privilege of working closely with Jose for the past 8+ years, I can attest that he is one of the best front end engineers and a leader/mentor that I have ever had the opportunity to collaborate with. He brings the perfect blend of technical expertise, creativity, and collaboration to the team. I wholeheartedly recommend him for the front end UI/UX engineering roles.\n\nHis contributions to our projects have consistently exceeded our expectations by demonstrating the deep understanding of modern front end frameworks. He played a pivotal role in defining and executing the UI/UX strategy that delighted both - our customers as well as the software development teams. His ability to quickly adapt emerging technologies and coach the team across multiple time zones continued the team towards the path of innovation.\n\nBeyond his technical expertise, he is an excellent team player, problem solver and an effective communicator for both, technical as well as non-technical stakeholders. His willingness to share knowledge and foster a collaborative and inclusive work environment has contributed significantly towards the team's growth, retention and success.\n\nJose is an asset to any organization. It is always a pleasure working with him!"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
