                        "size": "LARGE",
                        "textActionTarget": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/svengr",
                        "image": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5603AQF60QELNPlSRQ/profile-displayphoto-shrink_100_100/profile-displayphoto-shrink_100_100/0/1709081986643?e=1758153600&v=beta&t=IwnTuOEll5Fl2nntlUQUjUjC8M2hzlPuXyQhEXpsJZI",
                        "subComponents": [
                            {
                                "fixedListComponent": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "textComponent",
                                        "text": "Refugio (Jose) is a  brilliant UX visionary who can drive the growth of large products by delivering modern UX. I enjoyed working with him in Medrio as he led our UX  to build a common design language,  common UX components that worked flawlessly across multiple Javascript Frameworks. He worked with multiple cross functional teams to incorporate UX reviews in our SDLC by using Milo and JIRA. He has a great eye for detail and the passion to get things right.  He led a motivated team who respected him and liked his leadership that he had earned through experience and hard work."
